            <note corresp="#d536-f1" n="20" type="source" xml:id="d536-f1-content">
                <p>This telegram is reprinted from Miller, <hi rendition="#italic">My Diary</hi>,
                    vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 30.</p>
            </note>
